      "side": 1,
      "message": "This particular change seems fine, but what\u0027s our longer term plan for ensuring we have a single guaranteed place that define-logic will be performed before potentially referencing those defines in other headers/translation units? Today, SkTypes.h is that funnel.",
      "revId": "7e1cea7d3e71903c14c64fcdb818f10bf4701f1d",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
